# Packages may not run their own programs while installing (preinstall/install/postinstall).
# That is how npm supply-chain attacks start, and this project needs none of them: the four that ask
# (core-js, esbuild, unrs-resolver, workerd) ship their native binaries as optional dependencies, so
# skipping the scripts loses nothing. `npm run <script>` and `npm test` are unaffected.
# Added 2026-10-25 after the eslint-config loader incident (docs/knowledge/operations/incidents-log.md).
ignore-scripts=true
